OL,4,C'We're being left behind' - tourist    
OL,5,Chotspot struggles with one of UK's     
OL,6,Cworst phone signals                    
OL,7,GProblems accessing parking apps,       
OL,8,Gmaking card payments and completing    
OL,9,Gphone conversations are hampering      
OL,10,Gpeople in one of the UK's most popular 
OL,11,Gseaside towns - which is also one of   
OL,12,Gthe country's worst places for phone   
OL,13,Gsignal.                                
OL,15,FProlonged poor connectivity in Tenby   
OL,16,Fwas highlighted by the area's MP       
OL,17,Fearlier this week, who told a          
OL,18,FWestminster debate that a planned      
OL,19,Fphone mast upgrade in two years' time  
OL,20,Fwas "not good enough".                 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
