OL,4,CThe 'terrible joke' that scuppered     
OL,5,CMatthew Rhys' James Bond hopes         
OL,6,GHollywood actor Matthew Rhys has told  
OL,7,Ghow a "terrible joke" he made during a 
OL,8,GJames Bond audition may have scuppered 
OL,9,Ghis chances of being cast in the       
OL,10,Giconic role.                           
OL,12,FRhys went to the offices of the        
OL,13,FBroccoli family (who produced Bond     
OL,14,Ffilms) in London to audition for the   
OL,15,Frole in the early 2000s but said he    
OL,16,Fwas caught off guard by one particular 
OL,17,Fquestion.                              
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
